flowchart TD
    A[Numeric observations; labels excluded from fitting] --> B[Handle missing values and select features]
    B --> C[Scale features]
    C --> D{Clustering method}
    D -- K-Means --> E[Test k values and plot inertia]
    E --> F[Fit selected k with repeated initialization]
    D -- Hierarchical --> G[Compute linkage matrix]
    G --> H[Plot dendrogram and select a cut]
    F --> I[Cluster sizes and feature profiles]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Silhouette and stability checks]
    J --> K{Ground-truth labels available?}
    K -- Yes --> L[External score after fitting, e.g. ARI]
    K -- No --> M[Interpret descriptive profiles only]
    L --> N[State limitations and conclusion]
    M --> N
